    {
      "id": "beat",
      "title": { "zh": "长音、促音、拨音", "en": "Long sounds, small っ and ん" },
      "intro": {
        "zh": "日语按「拍」念：一个假名一拍，每拍差不多一样长，像拍手。长音、小的 っ、ん 也各占一拍，少了这一拍就成了另一个词。拗音（きゃ）两个字合起来只算一拍。",
        "en": "Japanese is spoken in beats: one kana, one beat, each about the same length, like clapping. A long sound, a small っ and ん each take a beat too; drop it and you get a different word. A joined sound like きゃ is only one beat."
      },
      "layout": "list",
      "items": [
        { "t": "おばあさん", "sub": "お・ば・あ・さ・ん", "rom": "obaasan", "say": "おばあさん",
          "zh": "长音：把前一个音拉长一拍。a 音后面加 あ，i 音后面加 い，u 音后面加 う。おばあさん（奶奶）5 拍，少一拍的 おばさん 是「阿姨」。",
          "en": "Long sound: stretch the sound before it for one more beat. After an a-sound add あ, after i add い, after u add う. おばあさん (grandma) has 5 beats; with one beat less, おばさん means \"aunt\".",
          "ex": [
            { "t": "お母さん", "r": "おかあさん", "zh": "妈妈", "en": "mother", "pic": "👩" },
            { "t": "おじいさん", "r": "おじいさん", "zh": "爷爷", "en": "grandfather", "pic": "👴" },
            { "t": "ふうせん", "r": "ふうせん", "zh": "气球", "en": "balloon", "pic": "🎈" }
          ] },
        { "t": "えいご", "sub": "え・い・ご", "rom": "eigo", "say": "えいご",
          "zh": "e 音后面的 い、o 音后面的 う，一般不单独念，而是把前面的音拉长：えいご（英语）念 eego，ありがとう 念 arigatoo。",
          "en": "An い after an e-sound, or an う after an o-sound, usually just makes that sound long: えいご (English) sounds like \"eego\", ありがとう like \"arigatoo\".",
          "ex": [
            { "t": "先生", "r": "せんせい", "zh": "老师", "en": "teacher", "pic": "👩‍🏫" },
            { "t": "時計", "r": "とけい", "zh": "钟", "en": "clock", "pic": "🕒" },
            { "t": "お父さん", "r": "おとうさん", "zh": "爸爸", "en": "father", "pic": "👨" }
          ] },
        { "t": "きっぷ", "sub": "き・っ・ぷ", "rom": "kippu", "say": "きっぷ",
          "zh": "小的 っ：停一拍、不出声，再念后面的音；罗马字把后面的辅音写两遍。きっぷ（票）是 3 拍。",
          "en": "Small っ: pause for one beat without a sound, then say the next sound. In romaji the next consonant is written twice. きっぷ (ticket) has 3 beats.",
          "ex": [
            { "t": "すっぱい", "r": "すっぱい", "zh": "酸", "en": "sour", "pic": "🍋" },
            { "t": "ちょっと", "r": "ちょっと", "zh": "有点；一点", "en": "a little", "pic": "🤏" }
          ] },
        { "t": "ほん", "sub": "ほ・ん", "rom": "hon", "say": "ほん",
          "zh": "ん：用鼻子出声，自己占一拍，别吞掉。ほん（书）是 2 拍。",
          "en": "ん: a sound through the nose that takes a whole beat. Don't swallow it. ほん (book) has 2 beats.",
          "ex": [
            { "t": "こんにちは", "r": "こんにちは", "zh": "你好", "en": "hello", "pic": "👋" },
            { "t": "電車", "r": "でんしゃ", "zh": "电车", "en": "train", "pic": "🚃" },
            { "t": "信号", "r": "しんごう", "zh": "红绿灯", "en": "traffic light", "pic": "🚦" }
          ] },
        { "t": "がっこう", "sub": "が・っ・こ・う", "rom": "gakkou", "say": "がっこう",
          "zh": "一起数拍子：がっこう（学校）是 4 拍，念 gakkoo。拗音只算一拍：りょ・う・り 是 3 拍。每拍念得一样长。",
          "en": "Count the beats together: がっこう (school) is 4 beats and sounds like \"gakkoo\". A joined sound counts as one: りょ・う・り is 3 beats. Give every beat the same length.",
          "ex": [
            { "t": "料理", "r": "りょうり", "zh": "做菜", "en": "cooking", "pic": "🍳" },
            { "t": "ゆうびんきょく", "r": "ゆうびんきょく", "zh": "邮局", "en": "post office", "pic": "📮" }
          ] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kata",
      "title": { "zh": "片假名的用法", "en": "Using katakana" },
      "intro": {
        "zh": "片假名和平假名读音一样（第一张表里的小字），主要用来写外来词（从别的语言借来的词）和外国人的名字。片假名的长音写成一条线「ー」。念的时候照日语的拍子念，别照英语念。",
        "en": "Katakana sounds just like hiragana (the small letters in the first chart). It is used mostly for words borrowed from other languages and for foreign names. A long sound is a dash 「ー」; say these words in Japanese beats, not the English way."
      },
      "layout": "list",
      "items": [
        { "t": "パン", "sub": "ぱん", "rom": "pan", "say": "パン",
          "zh": "外来词用片假名写，读音和平假名一样：パ＝ぱ。パン 是面包。",
          "en": "Borrowed words are written in katakana, with the same sounds as hiragana: パ = ぱ. パン means bread.",
          "ex": [
            { "t": "ペン", "r": "ペン", "zh": "笔", "en": "pen", "pic": "🖊️" },
            { "t": "ピアノ", "r": "ピアノ", "zh": "钢琴", "en": "piano", "pic": "🎹" }
          ] },
        { "t": "ノート", "sub": "のーと", "rom": "nooto", "say": "ノート",
          "zh": "「ー」把前一个音拉长一拍：ノート（笔记本）是 no-o-to 3 拍。",
